      "changes": [
        "A manual recheck or version upload now reports what it did: the response says whether a new version was found (new_version_found) and which version it replaced (previous_version). A failed check whose error has no message (e.g. a timeout) now reports the error type instead of an empty reason",
        "The API document, collection and integration lists accept a free-text search (q): every word has to appear in the title/name or the notes/description, ignoring case and diacritics (\"zakaznik\" finds \"Zákaznický\"), so the public and the team lists can be searched without loading everything",
